  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/826",
  "contentHtml": "<p>이전에 재과만에서 암석을 3D로 편집한 선생님 영상을 본 기억이 나서 이번에 수업준비를 하면서 저도 해봤습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1102\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1102</a></p><p>혹시 도움이 되실까하여 자세한 과정 알려드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>저는 일단 제 수업용 노트북(삼성)에 &quot;3D뷰어&quot;가 기본으로 들어있어서 가능했습니다.</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>1. <a href=\"https://sketchfab.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sketchfab.com/</a> 으로 가서 회원가입.(저는 구글 계정으로 간편 가입)</b></span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>2. 검색창에 찾고자 하는 이미지 영어로 검색</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bab4c503da98e3e5a0d516c3b7c686d88153be6d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bab4c503da98e3e5a0d516c3b7c686d88153be6d\" data-orgin-width=\"1317\" data-origin-height=\"332\"><div class=\"figcaption\">검색창에 찾고자 하는 이미지 영어로 검색</div></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>3. 다운로드 가능한 것만 필터링</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaeff1167d1cb3f6420f55ce9b86522b6e51ba7a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aaeff1167d1cb3f6420f55ce9b86522b6e51ba7a\" data-orgin-width=\"1019\" data-origin-height=\"684\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>4. 원하는 이미지를 클릭한 후 아래로 내려가면 &quot;다운로드 3D 모델&quot;을 클릭</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1904ce89457287bf1fe999ff3698c9bc507dadf2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1904ce89457287bf1fe999ff3698c9bc507dadf2\" data-orgin-width=\"1044\" data-origin-height=\"815\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>5. gltf 형식으로 다운받아서 압축풀기</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9385a51bcac0744f40a544dc2ef07e8cef3df89\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9385a51bcac0744f40a544dc2ef07e8cef3df89\" data-orgin-width=\"908\" data-origin-height=\"729\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>6. 노트북 3D 뷰어 열기(윈도우 옆 검색에서 찾아도 됩니다)</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4e3bd6a0ab58a952fd9fc21c37fa78cca842b74\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e4e3bd6a0ab58a952fd9fc21c37fa78cca842b74\" data-orgin-width=\"372\" data-origin-height=\"676\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>7. 3D뷰어에서 파일 클릭- 열어보기 클릭</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7b816636cb8594516a0894b55b4a1010b533f43\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f7b816636cb8594516a0894b55b4a1010b533f43\" data-orgin-width=\"1006\" data-origin-height=\"907\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>8. 아래 그림과 같이 보이는 파일 클릭</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f597d3b4edda798ccb3f0819bbf293ffb843539\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f597d3b4edda798ccb3f0819bbf293ffb843539\" data-orgin-width=\"366\" data-origin-height=\"284\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>9. 내려받은 3D 이미지를 볼 수 있습니다. 파일을 클릭해서 다른 이름으로 저장해두시면 수업하실 때마다 열어보실 수 있습니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4988bc92b018617efffe48beb9363f655872336f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4988bc92b018617efffe48beb9363f655872336f\" data-orgin-width=\"1156\" data-origin-height=\"892\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans Light';\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>10. 직접 해보는 모습(영상)</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvpji3pa0plyvhkv3x2kocfkc@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvpji3pa0plyvhkv3x2kocfkc%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33170110244%26signature%3DDsSAxz7uZRdTIjC70JiahszmRFI%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvpji3pa0plyvhkv3x2kocfkc?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cGppM3BhMHBseXZoa3YzeDJrb2Nma2MiLCJ0aWQiOiI3NGY5YTkyNy0yMzgwLTQ1MWQtYmFjNi04NTNhMTUyMmFiMjUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODU4NzV9.Trxh6-MIGeSJwmW3GrwsWFTVLJwuzRNm22xnFBM6ldOHnbvk3jTKiXUhubld-GS5ki7NkIprnMvfJy9q3nPtfw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
